{"aligned_passages":[{"anchor":"hypothesis-specific-obstructions","mapping_field":"claim_ids","mapping_ref":"sha256:0f219e7bffa9a7fd19ae5e29b6712a52433038999248a52795a946ab77beb187/papers/long.json","paper_href":"/api/v1/papers/long?manifest=a95759ce5c96e8226b9411d42d1138f4b439d3c1a2e4ebf7160579b702e450e1","passage_ref":"sha256:9db121aa3907c3f1a8a48d6797094bb13e0c3efb5c7f42f8664bb4e6fba1025c/papers/long.md/sha256:0f219e7bffa9a7fd19ae5e29b6712a52433038999248a52795a946ab77beb187/papers/long.json/passages/hypothesis-specific-obstructions","query_href":"/api/v1/papers/query?manifest=a95759ce5c96e8226b9411d42d1138f4b439d3c1a2e4ebf7160579b702e450e1&paper=long&passage=hypothesis-specific-obstructions","reading_href":"/api/v1/papers/reading?manifest=a95759ce5c96e8226b9411d42d1138f4b439d3c1a2e4ebf7160579b702e450e1&paper=long&passage=hypothesis-specific-obstructions","span":{"end_byte":420549,"end_line":3870,"start_byte":391783,"start_line":3634},"stage":"long"}],"lenses":{"consumers":"/api/v1/graph?manifest=a95759ce5c96e8226b9411d42d1138f4b439d3c1a2e4ebf7160579b702e450e1&view=arguments&node=long.prop-carry-survivor-extinction&direction=consumers&assumptions=true","direct_passages":"/api/v1/papers/query?manifest=a95759ce5c96e8226b9411d42d1138f4b439d3c1a2e4ebf7160579b702e450e1&node=long.prop-carry-survivor-extinction&relation=direct","prerequisite_uses":"/api/v1/papers/query?manifest=a95759ce5c96e8226b9411d42d1138f4b439d3c1a2e4ebf7160579b702e450e1&node=long.prop-carry-survivor-extinction&relation=prerequisites","prerequisites":"/api/v1/graph?manifest=a95759ce5c96e8226b9411d42d1138f4b439d3c1a2e4ebf7160579b702e450e1&view=arguments&node=long.prop-carry-survivor-extinction&assumptions=true"},"neighborhood_href":"/api/v1/neighborhood?manifest=a95759ce5c96e8226b9411d42d1138f4b439d3c1a2e4ebf7160579b702e450e1&ref=sha256%3A5d6514073ac52d75d011c84ff900912363a94ff7fe2e141210e6bf3c445c0cc1%2Fnodes%2Flong.prop-carry-survivor-extinction","record":{"assumption_ids":[],"boundary":"The evidence mapping records a Lean proof of exactly this statement. Lean status per paper is kept in authored/evidence-status.json.","citation_ids":["cite.long.prop-carry-survivor-extinction"],"evidence_ids":["mapping.long.prop-carry-survivor-extinction"],"id":"long.prop-carry-survivor-extinction","kind":"claim","label":"Long record Proposition 10.12 (Period exclusion for the totient series)","locator":"Long record Proposition 10.12, p. 118, label prop:carry-survivor-extinction","source_id":"paper.long.pdf","statement":"*For $\\sum_n\\varphi(n)/2^n$, the cited finite test proves that $\\mathrm{totientTail}(N+h)-\\mathrm{totientTail}(N)$ is not an integer by excluding every possible integer state in a bounded range within finitely many steps. If the series were rational, some positive period $h_0$ would make these tail differences integral for every sufficiently large $N$. Telescoping would then give integrality also for every positive multiple $mh_0$.*\n\n*Consequently, the required certificate supply is: for every $h_0\\ge1$ and every lower bound $N_0$, there exist $m\\ge1$, $N\\ge N_0$ and a finite test length $K$ excluding integrality for $(mh_0,N)$. The unbounded choice of $N$ is essential; a counterexample before the unknown eventual threshold does not exclude an eventual period. It is sufficient instead to obtain such certificates for $h=\\mathrm{lcm}(1,\\ldots,t)$ with both $t$ and $N$ exceeding arbitrary prescribed lower bounds. The supplied finite theorem excludes the tail differences for $1\\le h\\le16$ at $(N,L)=(14,9)$, and hence excludes rational values whose reduced denominator divides $2^{14}(2^h-1)$ for one of those $h$. It does not establish the unbounded certificate supply.*\n\n***Scope.** The Lean declarations used in this comparison concern the totient series of Problem 249. Their carry recurrences may suggest constructions for Problem 257, but applying them there requires a new argument for the divisor transform of its chosen support. The totient-specific theorems do not supply that argument.*","status":"unverified"},"ref":"sha256:5d6514073ac52d75d011c84ff900912363a94ff7fe2e141210e6bf3c445c0cc1/nodes/long.prop-carry-survivor-extinction","relations":[{"derived":false,"family":"arguments","from":"sha256:5d6514073ac52d75d011c84ff900912363a94ff7fe2e141210e6bf3c445c0cc1/nodes/long.prop-carry-survivor-extinction","id":"sha256:5d6514073ac52d75d011c84ff900912363a94ff7fe2e141210e6bf3c445c0cc1/edges/%5B%22long.prop-carry-survivor-extinction%22%2C%22lean.ErdosProblems.Erdos257.PaperCompleteR21.paper_carry_survivor_extinction%22%2C%22formalizes%22%5D","kind":"formalizes","record_ref":"sha256:5d6514073ac52d75d011c84ff900912363a94ff7fe2e141210e6bf3c445c0cc1/edges/%5B%22long.prop-carry-survivor-extinction%22%2C%22lean.ErdosProblems.Erdos257.PaperCompleteR21.paper_carry_survivor_extinction%22%2C%22formalizes%22%5D","semantic_class":"formalization_correspondence","to":"sha256:5d6514073ac52d75d011c84ff900912363a94ff7fe2e141210e6bf3c445c0cc1/nodes/lean.ErdosProblems.Erdos257.PaperCompleteR21.paper_carry_survivor_extinction"},{"derived":false,"family":"arguments","from":"sha256:5d6514073ac52d75d011c84ff900912363a94ff7fe2e141210e6bf3c445c0cc1/nodes/long.prop-carry-survivor-extinction","id":"sha256:5d6514073ac52d75d011c84ff900912363a94ff7fe2e141210e6bf3c445c0cc1/edges/%5B%22long.prop-carry-survivor-extinction%22%2C%22lean.ErdosProblems.Erdos257.PaperCompleteR21.paper_periodLcm_is_prefix_lcm%22%2C%22formalizes%22%5D","kind":"formalizes","record_ref":"sha256:5d6514073ac52d75d011c84ff900912363a94ff7fe2e141210e6bf3c445c0cc1/edges/%5B%22long.prop-carry-survivor-extinction%22%2C%22lean.ErdosProblems.Erdos257.PaperCompleteR21.paper_periodLcm_is_prefix_lcm%22%2C%22formalizes%22%5D","semantic_class":"formalization_correspondence","to":"sha256:5d6514073ac52d75d011c84ff900912363a94ff7fe2e141210e6bf3c445c0cc1/nodes/lean.ErdosProblems.Erdos257.PaperCompleteR21.paper_periodLcm_is_prefix_lcm"},{"derived":true,"family":"provenance","from":"sha256:5d6514